OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 22 NOV    
OL,4,CEVENTS                                 
OL,6,CG1965FNewspapers report that Michael  
OL,7,FAspel has been kidnapped by students   
OL,8,Ffrom Kensington College of Estate      
OL,9,FManagement.                            
OL,11,FThey reportedly held him hostage for a 
OL,12,Fdonation to the Imperial Cancer        
OL,13,FResearch Fund.                         
OL,15,FAspel paid his own donation and is     
OL,16,Freleased in time to read the evening   
OL,17,Fnews.                                  
OL,23,Sppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
